    "text": "BY Virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 27 (1) of the Universities Act, No. 16 of 1978, I, Kabir Hashim, Minister ofHighways, Higher Education and Investment Promotion, do by this Order, on the recommendation of the University GrantsCommission, amend the Order made under Section 21 of the aforesaid Act, establishing the South Eastern University of SriLanka and published in Gazette Extraordinary, No. 916/7 of March 27, 1996, as amended from time to time, by the additionimmediately after item (c) in Column II under the heading \u2018\u2018Department of Study\u2019\u2019 which correspond to the entry \u2018\u2018Faculty ofArts and Culture\u2019\u2019 in Column I under the heading \u2018\u2018Faculty\u2019\u2019 in the Schedule II to such Order, of the following new item :\u2013",
